 "journeys": {
  "classes": [
   {
    "name": "A \u00b7 The stranger at the door",
    "standing": {
     "anticipated": 1,
     "drafted": 1,
     "live": 4
    },
    "stops": [
     "Where it stops: nothing comes back to them. The acknowledgment to the applicant's own inbox waits on the mail seam clearing DNS (A-4), so from where the applicant stands, the first thing the cooperative does is go quiet. The gap is named in the steward's notice rather than swallo\u2026"
    ],
    "stories": 6
   },
   {
    "name": "B \u00b7 The guild participant \u00b7 Class Three, virtual",
    "standing": {
     "proposed": 10
    },
    "stops": [
     "Where it stops, and this one is worse than waiting: the participation index today invites a reader to join the guild and hands them to a way the front door does not carry, so the very first step of this sequence refuses without saying so, on the live site. Until the board adopts \u2026"
    ],
    "stories": 10
   },
   {
    "name": "C \u00b7 The community participant \u00b7 Class Three, at the hub",
    "standing": {
     "drafted": 3,
     "live": 1
    },
    "stops": [
     "Where it stops, twice: the level they are enrolling at, Threshold, Footing, or Standing, is not on the surface, so enrollment lands without a level and a steward carries it out of band until the level machinery is built (C-1). And no class-scoped persona has walked any of this in\u2026"
    ],
    "stories": 4
   },
   {
    "name": "D \u00b7 The co-working participant \u00b7 Class Two",
    "standing": {
     "anticipated": 1,
     "drafted": 1,
     "live": 2
    },
    "stops": [
     "Where it stops: the counting has no rates yet, so credits accrue and the tally cannot be shown until the Q3 counting rules give contributions their values (D-2), and the invitation threshold that reads from that same tally waits with it (D-3). And the instrument is not where the \u2026"
    ],
    "stories": 4
   },
   {
    "name": "E \u00b7 The cooperative member \u00b7 Class One, the patron",
    "standing": {
     "anticipated": 1,
     "live": 9,
     "proposed": 2
    },
    "stops": [
     "Where it stops: the two acts a new member reaches for soonest are both proposed. Standing as the carrier of a body of work waits on the standing module and P-05 (E-9), and inviting someone along the access track waits on the invitation count and P-04 (E-8). The tallies that make \u2026"
    ],
    "stories": 12
   },
   {
    "name": "F \u00b7 The roles \u00b7 grants, not titles",
    "standing": {
     "drafted": 1,
     "live": 4
    },
    "stops": [],
    "stories": 5
   },
   {
    "name": "G \u00b7 The instrument \u00b7 capabilities without authority",
    "standing": {
     "live": 2,
     "proposed": 1
    },
    "stops": [],
    "stories": 3
   },
   {
    "name": "H \u00b7 Sharing a project, class by class",
    "standing": {
     "drafted": 1,
     "live": 4,
     "proposed": 3
    },
    "stops": [
     "Where it stops: today only a cooperative member can do it, because the board is scoped to an active membership. The guild's version of this act is the piece of the guild people will feel first, and it is proposed (B-5). The carrier act, which is how a person's name attaches to a \u2026"
    ],
    "stories": 8
   },
   {
    "name": "X \u00b7 Every participant, whatever the class",
    "standing": {
     "live": 5
    },
    "stops": [],
    "stories": 5
   }
  ],
